# AMD64 thunk export spec -- apphelp.dll.
#
# apphelp_test resolves ApphelpCheckShellObject via LoadLibraryA +
# GetProcAddress, both answered in the guest namespace by the dispatcher
# overrides; its assertions are plain pointer/integer calls with no callbacks,
# which is what makes it the first test expected to EXECUTE rather than skip.
DLL apphelp.dll
FROM-SPEC auto
